{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkdy637yMX3vHrcPcLdD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here.\n\n- I've scrolled six screens, all of them dark, with numbers in every corner, and I'm still on the first company, הראל.\n- Most of these options are \"מניות\" at 93%, 96%, 99%. Then there's \"S&P 500\", which is English letters. That's not for me.\n- The one that caught my eye is \"כספי (שקלי)\": \"מניות 0%\" and \"מט\"ח 0%\", so no shares and no dollars. It says \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת 3 שנים 4.25%\", and it shows numbers, not just \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". The fee is \"0.57% מהחיסכון\", and there's no fee on what you put in (\"0% מההפקדה\").\n- I know הראל. It's a big insurance company, and the top screen says it's supervised by \"רשות שוק ההון\". That makes me feel better.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:** If I had to pick from this page, I'd take הראל, the \"כספי (שקלי)\" track. It's the only one with no shares and no foreign currency, so it seems the closest to my deposits. It earned 4.25% a year, which sounds like more than the bank gives me. But I'm not sure, and before I sign anything I'll call you or ask at the bank. I never got past הראל, so I don't know if another company is cheaper or better. I also don't know what 0.57% means in shekels, or whether the bank takes more from me now.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The explanation at the top. It's tax-free inside the fund, you can take the money out any time, and it's supervised. That was clear and good.\n2. The search and sorting boxes. I didn't touch them.\n3. The הראל list: \"מניות סחיר\", \"כללי\", \"מניות\", \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדדי מניות\", \"אג\"ח סחיר\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"קיימות\", \"אשראי ואג\"ח עם מניות\". After that I stopped.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"מט\"ח\", \"עוקב מדדי\", \"S&P 500\", \"סחיר\", \"קיימות\", \"קופה 15283\" and the little arrow next to it.\n- \"123 ממקור / 123 מחושב\".\n- The colored rings. Teal and yellow on black, and I couldn't tell what they mean.\n- Many tracks just say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a return. Is that bad?\n- \"אג\"ח סחיר\" says 0% shares, but it shows no return at all.\n\n**Where I got tired:** By the third screen there were too many percentages, and no sentence telling me what's safe. The white-on-black is hard on my eyes, and the pale grey line \"הקישו על מספר...\" I could barely read. There are 40 screens and 12 companies, and I'd never get through them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3711,"cache_read_input_tokens":11703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3711},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"609b6693-cbc9-4f91-aa91-a7e7c895accd","uuid":"468cc439-c3f7-4ee9-b9a6-bcf68760842e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:20:25.296Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkdy5ojbW4Xrbi7d2zat"}
